actions; 
• Ensures program-related damage throughout the affected area is efficiently and 
accurately assessed; 
• Serves as the field-level SME and addresses complex eligibility questions that arise 
from site assessments; 
• Functions as a PA PDA team member if the PDA is localized and roles can be 
combined; 
• Collects, aggregates, and archives joint PDA data from field team members;  
• Creates narratives and tables used to document validated damage; and 
• Oversees PDA team members. 
